::: {.cell}

:::

2. What __class__ is text normally stored in? <div class='webex-radiogroup' id='radio_TRXAFFXEZL'><label><input type="radio" autocomplete="off" name="radio_TRXAFFXEZL" value=""></input> <span>Numeric</span></label><label><input type="radio" autocomplete="off" name="radio_TRXAFFXEZL" value=""></input> <span>Logical</span></label><label><input type="radio" autocomplete="off" name="radio_TRXAFFXEZL" value="answer"></input> <span>String</span></label></div>



